1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,098
¡Ja, ja, ja, ja!

2
00:00:02,175 --> 00:00:03,986
¿Esta es tu noria?

3
00:00:06,904 --> 00:00:09,349
Hermano, gira al revés.

4
00:00:09,426 --> 00:00:10,568
Al revés…

5
00:00:10,626 --> 00:00:12,245
El ángulo de las paletas,

6
00:00:12,628 --> 00:00:13,583
va contra el agua.

7
00:00:14,013 --> 00:00:15,791
Si las volteo, gira.

8
00:00:15,865 --> 00:00:17,367
Doce paletas,

9
00:00:17,437 --> 00:00:19,325
¿antes del atardecer?

10
00:00:20,839 --> 00:00:22,368
Misión sequía:

11
00:00:22,439 --> 00:00:24,678
vence hoy al atardecer.

12
00:00:24,747 --> 00:00:25,299
Qin Shuang,

13
00:00:25,355 --> 00:00:27,086
tres turnos, dos horas.

14
00:00:27,218 --> 00:00:28,822
¡Turno uno, al agua!

15
00:00:28,886 --> 00:00:30,657
¡Turno dos, tablas!

16
00:00:32,691 --> 00:00:33,894
¡Cuatro!

17
00:00:34,289 --> 00:00:34,865
Ocho.

18
00:00:37,934 --> 00:00:38,989
Doce,

19
00:00:39,559 --> 00:00:40,352
¡listo!

20
00:00:41,118 --> 00:00:42,598
Anciano Han, abra.

21
00:00:44,667 --> 00:00:46,658
Gira…

22
00:00:51,088 --> 00:00:52,890
¡Gira!

23
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:55,920
Agua…

24
00:00:55,987 --> 00:00:57,693
¡Llegó el agua!

25
00:00:58,181 --> 00:00:59,787
Señor Xu.

26
00:00:59,854 --> 00:01:00,955
Levántense,

27
00:01:01,028 --> 00:01:02,499
¡no se hinquen!

28
00:01:02,559 --> 00:01:04,872
Mi… presa…

29
00:01:05,245 --> 00:01:06,464
Don Qian,

30
00:01:06,530 --> 00:01:09,204
usa tu presa para lavarte los pies.

31
00:01:11,094 --> 00:01:13,387
Misión sequía: cumplida.

32
00:01:13,462 --> 00:01:15,012
Semillas a salvo.

33
00:01:15,081 --> 00:01:16,252
Toma agua.

34
00:01:16,564 --> 00:01:18,431
¡Hermano, ya gira bien!

35
00:01:18,511 --> 00:01:19,917
Sonreíste.

36
00:01:20,230 --> 00:01:20,645
No.

37
00:01:23,830 --> 00:01:24,703
Hermano…

38
00:01:24,768 --> 00:01:26,270
Al norte.

39
00:01:26,333 --> 00:01:27,308
El viento está frío.

40
00:01:30,011 --> 00:01:30,972
Lan…

41
00:01:31,191 --> 00:01:32,993
¡Langostas!

42
00:01:35,031 --> 00:01:36,853
Xiaohe, agárrate.
